<title>EGYPT: Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 1.3 bln pounds.</title>
<headline>Egypt offers 182-day T-bills worth 1.3 bln pounds.</headline>
<dateline>CAIRO 1997-06-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Egyptian treasury offered 182-day treasury bills worth 1.3 billion pounds for auction on June 16 for issue on June 17 when 182-day bills worth 927.625 million pounds mature.</p>
<p>The average yield at the last auction was 8.956 percent.</p>
<p>($1 = 3.40 pounds)</p>
</text>
